# Caliza Estratos motion clips: numbered frames for checking transitions by eye (not part of the evidence set).
clip @OUT@/boot 36 33
wait 600
expect-screen home
press down
clip @OUT@/home-focus 12 33
press up
press cross
clip @OUT@/home-to-library 14 33
press right
clip @OUT@/library-focus 12 33
press circle
wait 400
press down
press down
press cross
expect-screen settings
press down
press down
press down
press cross
clip @OUT@/settings-open 10 33
press right
clip @OUT@/settings-change 10 33
